# Go API security

- JWT in HttpOnly cookies; `SECURE_COOKIES=true` in production (HTTPS)
- `X-Internal-Api-Key` on `/internal/*` only — never expose internal routes on public CORS
- Workspace membership checked before watchlist, research, or signals mutations
- Never log tokens, `INTERNAL_API_KEY`, or raw API keys
- Validate external payloads (n8n, Alpaca, FinBERT) at service boundary
